<title>PHILIPPINES: Hi Cement to issue preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Hi Cement to issue preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hi Cement Corp said on Friday it would issue 20 million preferred shares to cover the increase of its authorised capital to 2.245 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The preferred shares will be sold in several tranches.</p>
<p>The company is currently looking for an underwriter for its preferred shares offering, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
